<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>pyenv - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/pyenv/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/pyenv/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>使用 pyenv 管理多个 Python 版本依赖环境</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;从接触Python以来，一直都是采用&lt;a href="https://virtualenv.pypa.io/en/stable/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenv&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://pypi.python.org/pypi/virtualenvwrapper" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenvwrapper&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;来管理不同项目的依赖环境，通过&lt;code&gt;workon&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code&gt;mkvirtualenv&lt;/code&gt;等命令进行虚拟环境切换，很是愉快。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>